  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EUs s&#xE4;rskilde represent (EUSR) upphandlade i konkurrens en local NGO, ACIPS, att samordnade dialogen mellan det civila samh&#xE4;llet och politiska partier kring fem prioriterade teman f&#xF6;r EU-n&#xE4;rmandet. Initiativet samlade 24 NGOer inom ett informellt och &#xF6;ppet n&#xE4;tverk: &quot;Citizens for Europe&quot; Fem konferenser planderades och genomf&#xF6;rdes med nio politiska partier inf&#xF6;r vilka bakgrundsanalyer f&#xF6;rbereddes.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The EU Special Representative (EUSR) in 2010 based on call for proposals selected a local NGO, ACIPS to coordinated the political dialogue between civil society and political parties during the year of national elections. The initiative gathered 34 civil society organisations (CSOs) in an informal and open network called &quot;Citizens for Europe&quot; (CfE)</narrative>
  </description>
